{
  "sp": 2,
  "threshold": 3,
  "mode": "default",
  "reason": "Two bounded repo-side fixes (ci.yml !cancelled() verdict semantics + loc-ceiling belt test) with evaluated-expression guard tests; the factory-side park-clearing rule is external and gets documented, not coded."
